                        "recommendationid": "238190625",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198066817631",
                            "num_reviews": 262,
                            "playtime_forever": 66,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 66,
                            "last_played": 1605551321
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I got this for a dollar.\n\nTo summarize, It's just Warcraft 3 but not that good. Art direction in particular makes it feel like a cheap and uninspired mobile game. In fact, while I'm bringing that up - the UI is really, really bad here. Just really blocky and uninspiring. \n\nWith that being said, the game has a lot of good aspects. \n\nFor example, I was REALLY impressed with the cutscenes. I really like how they use the animations present in the engine and use really dynamic camera tricks. I've never seen an RTS do that before, and it's pretty genius.\n\nThe game feel is pretty nice and responsive, exactly what I'd expect from an RTS. \n\nAlso I did NOT understand the story bro I cannot tell you anything about it.\n\nThis game is on my to-replay list, but not because it's particularly good.",
